      For a life unending'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1739505665
    m_Localized: Knocks adjacent enemies back {distance} tiles, grants <B>{armor}</B> armor and increases defense for <B>{defenseUpTurns}</B> {defenseUpTurns:plural:turn|turns}
    m_Metadata:
